async function renamePreset(id){const x=presets.find(p=>p.id===Number(id));if(!x)return;const name=prompt('Rename filter set',x.name);if(!name?.trim())return;await api('/filter-presets/'+x.id,{method:'PUT',body:JSON.stringify({...x,name:name.trim()})});await loadPresets();toast(`Renamed filter set to: ${name.trim()}`)}
