async function loadJobHistory(){const limit=Number(jobHistoryPageSize.value)||25,params=new URLSearchParams({limit,offset:jobHistoryPage*limit});try{const page=await api('/jobs/history?'+params.toString()),rows=page.items||[];jobHistoryList.innerHTML=rows.length?`<div class="jobHistoryTable"><div class="jobHistoryTableHead"><span>Category</span><span>Job details</span><span>Run date / time</span><span>Completion date / time</span><span>Result</span></div>${rows.map(j=>{const category=String(j.category||'System'),categoryClass=category.toLowerCase().replace(/[^a-z]+/g,''),started=validDate(j.started_at)?fullDateTime(j.started_at):'Unknown',finished=validDate(j.finished_at)?fullDateTime(j.finished_at):(j.state==='running'?'In progress':'—'),summary=category==='Scraping'?`${j.added} new · ${j.updated} updated · ${j.skipped} skipped`:(j.details||j.error||'No additional details'),meta=[j.kind,j.mode,j.provider].filter(Boolean).join(' · ');return `<article class="jobHistoryRow"><span class="jobCategory ${categoryClass}">${esc(category)}</span><div class="jobHistoryDetails"><b>${esc(j.title||j.kind||'Background job')}</b><small>${esc(meta)}</small>${j.error?`<small class="jobError">${esc(j.error)}</small>`:''}</div><time datetime="${attr(j.started_at||'')}">${esc(started)}</time><time datetime="${attr(j.finished_at||'')}">${esc(finished)}</time><div class="jobHistoryResult"><span class="jobState ${esc(j.state)}">${esc(j.state)}</span><small title="${attr(summary)}">${esc(summary)}</small></div></article>`}).join('')}</div>`:'<div class="empty">No recorded job activity.</div>';renderJobHistoryPagination(page.total||0,limit)}catch(e){jobHistoryList.innerHTML=`<div class="empty">${esc(e.message)}</div>`;jobHistoryPagination.innerHTML=''}}
